## No warranty, no advice

Results are planning values and general reference, not engineering, estimating, legal or financial advice for
any specific project. Verify quantities, factors and prices against your own data and your suppliers. CSI and
MasterFormat are the property of their owners; codes here map to CSI division titles only.
